# Core

Product: **Smart Tools** — free online utility/productivity tools (calculators, converters, generators, trackers).
Repo/project: **ToolifyLab**. No admin app. Do not introduce admin-console concepts.

Current UI copy, metadata, and PWA strings still say ToolifyLab. Do not mass-rebrand unless the task explicitly asks. When writing new user-facing product naming, prefer Smart Tools; keep ToolifyLab as project/company.

## Stack (reuse; do not add parallels)

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript (`strict`), pnpm, alias `@/*` → `src/*`
- Tailwind v4 tokens in `src/app/globals.css` (`@theme inline`); no `tailwind.config`
- shadcn/ui (new-york) + Radix + CVA + `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`
- Icons: Lucide (`components.json` `iconLibrary: lucide`). `react-icons` only in footer socials
- Motion (`motion/react`) already in use — do not add another animation library
- Forms: react-hook-form + Zod where present. Toasts: sonner. Theme: next-themes, `defaultTheme="light"`
- PWA: Serwist (`@serwist/next`). Sitemap: next-sitemap. Analytics: `@vercel/analytics`

Do not add MUI, Chakra, another CSS framework, another icon set, another PWA library, or a second catalog/search/SEO system.

## Architecture

- Routes: `src/app/{tool-id}/page.tsx` (metadata + page shell)
- Tool UI: `src/components/tools/`; image tools: `src/components/Image-tools/`
- Home discovery: `src/components/homepage/`
- Primitives: `src/components/ui/`
- Catalog: `src/lib/tools.ts` — source of truth for tools/categories
- Shared helpers: `src/lib/utils.ts` (`cn`, formatters, `calculateEMI`, `calculateAge`, storage)
- API: only `src/app/api/generate-prompt/route.ts` (Gemini). Calculators run client-side

Prefer Server Components. Use `'use client'` only for interactive tools/chrome. Keep components small. Reuse existing hooks (`src/hooks/`) and UI primitives.

## Behavior

- Preserve existing functionality, formulas, routes, and data shapes
- Smallest clean change. Inspect relevant files before coding
- Accessible: labels, focus-visible rings, `aria-*`, 44px touch targets (`.touch-target`)
- Responsive: mobile-first; do not hide primary tool actions to save space
- Loading / empty / error: use existing `loading`, `skeleton`, `sonner`, `error-boundary`, `not-found`
- Security: never expose `GEMINI_API_KEY` or secrets; validate API input; keep `poweredByHeader: false`
- Do not fabricate user counts, ratings, usage stats, or testimonials

## Validation

After changes, run what you touched: `pnpm type-check`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm format:check`. Full gate: `pnpm validate`.
No test suite exists; if calculation logic changes, add tests rather than silently altering formulas.
